# Architecture

## Project Structure

<!-- Define your {{STACK}} project structure here -->

```
├── src/
│   ├── components/         # Reusable UI components
│   ├── constants/          # Constants and configuration
│   ├── context/            # State management providers
│   ├── hooks/              # Custom hooks
│   ├── services/           # API/backend service layer
│   ├── types/              # Type definitions
│   ├── utils/              # Utility functions
│   └── __tests__/          # Test files
├── docs/                   # Project documentation
└── scripts/                # Utility scripts
```

## Layered Build Order

1. **Foundation** — `src/types/`, `src/constants/`, `src/utils/`
2. **Services** — `src/services/` (API clients, etc.)
3. **Context & Hooks** — `src/context/`, `src/hooks/`
4. **Components** — `src/components/`
5. **Screens** — Application screens/pages
6. **Backend** — Server-side functions (if applicable)
7. **Infrastructure** — CI/CD, security rules, config

## Data Flow

```
Screen → Hook/Context → Service → Backend API → Database
                             ↕
                        State updates
```
